{"screen_name": "Amu_let_", "file": "Amu_let_", "name": "アム", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1582048611558633472/QRH-Xil3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3356639900/1625884389/1500x500", "description": "フリーイラストレーター ｜ commission：open｜https://lit.link/en/amuck｜I appreciate all likes, comments and follows❤️", "total_works": 10, "scraped_works": 10, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}], "correction": [{"amount": 1000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T08:42:35.157238+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8000, "correction": 1000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 8000, "max": 8000}, "correction": {"min": 1000, "max": 1000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/ck_Amu", "name": "ck_Amu"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://lit.link/en/amuck", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/14788246", "name": "14788246"}, {"label": "SKIMA", "url": "https://skima.jp/profile?id=128660", "name": "128660"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/216ef52f/uploads/origins/f1b7b431-c469-4f0f-9be8-c86a76738576?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3dd12f5a274b272effa827799c7746ea", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/216ef52f/uploads/origins/f1b7b431-c469-4f0f-9be8-c86a76738576?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3dd12f5a274b272effa827799c7746ea, https://si.imgix.net/216ef52f/uploads/origins/f1b7b431-c469-4f0f-9be8-c86a76738576?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bc1b34c96693a35ef692c99c273d4590 2x, https://si.imgix.net/216ef52f/uploads/origins/f1b7b431-c469-4f0f-9be8-c86a76738576?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=52004474e5fa9ee160cab216d566b765 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/066d8fc6/uploads/origins/fffcad1c-57f4-4eb2-8c7c-c7e32ecfa08c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41f761b4c3d4ca743a8f9723463709a6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/066d8fc6/uploads/origins/fffcad1c-57f4-4eb2-8c7c-c7e32ecfa08c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41f761b4c3d4ca743a8f9723463709a6, https://si.imgix.net/066d8fc6/uploads/origins/fffcad1c-57f4-4eb2-8c7c-c7e32ecfa08c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5440cc43768aced7e39340a531c8810b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/066d8fc6/uploads/origins/fffcad1c-57f4-4eb2-8c7c-c7e32ecfa08c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81fd407791588d6a0de3a8d3e5fa0880 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "您能为我画两个忍者男孩角色--雾和乌鸦吗？参考资料附在下面。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QBrm3u6P2jLlAwK3lKpkJ57MRLH-T4zf?usp=share_link\n橙色的那个叫 \"雾\"（17 岁），性格相对沉稳，少言寡语；而蓝色的那个叫 \"乌鸦\"（16 岁），性格外向，有点淘气。它们从小就是战斗伙伴。\n您可以随意画出他们之间的任何姿势和互动！一切完全由您决定。您可以画他们的战斗姿势，也可以画他们在某个舒适的地方休息和拥抱。我希望看到你笔下的男孩们！\n请慢慢享受，非常感谢你的考虑！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QBrm3u6P2jLlAwK3lKpkJ57MRLH-T4zf?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bc58b70/uploads/origins/843c0933-c0cf-4b99-9b7a-84dd928cfe57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70e32732df865168cc52bc0aa07a3be9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9bc58b70/uploads/origins/843c0933-c0cf-4b99-9b7a-84dd928cfe57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70e32732df865168cc52bc0aa07a3be9, https://si.imgix.net/9bc58b70/uploads/origins/843c0933-c0cf-4b99-9b7a-84dd928cfe57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=097d87ac3f3f65d5686cefdfc4c1b226 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9bc58b70/uploads/origins/843c0933-c0cf-4b99-9b7a-84dd928cfe57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2064ec5e5ea5978402aa763ed58dc2e7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "您好！我非常喜欢你为 \"仙之纪 \"画的一些画。您能不能把乌鸦和雷恩画在一个像米舍拉姆那样的环境里，背景是湖面上的灯笼？在姿势方面，我希望您能画出他们两人互相注视对方的眼睛，并俯身好像要接吻的样子，乌鸦抓住雷恩的下巴，让他的脸朝上。如果你能在他们的脸上表现出虔诚和渴望的表情，仿佛他们永远都不想放开对方，那就太好了。\n\n如果不适合您，请拒绝这一要求。非常感谢您的考虑！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64f9939d/uploads/origins/eff61a15-95e7-4afa-8bf0-9faf585bef53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6dd83aa66c136293ce3313fb5bcdc32", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64f9939d/uploads/origins/eff61a15-95e7-4afa-8bf0-9faf585bef53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6dd83aa66c136293ce3313fb5bcdc32, https://si.imgix.net/64f9939d/uploads/origins/eff61a15-95e7-4afa-8bf0-9faf585bef53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe309d03a0db34d479863693561311ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64f9939d/uploads/origins/eff61a15-95e7-4afa-8bf0-9faf585bef53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7faf99f733b5a19b7200c59a75846467 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好我想请您为我和我的朋友们制作一件艺术品！\n\n我想让我的朋友 Eris 在我的咖啡馆边喝咖啡边对我咆哮！我想让她看起来很沮丧，就像在发泄什么不好的事情！她精力充沛，声音响亮，所以要在这里描绘出她的情绪\n\n我希望我的角色 Ivo 看起来很开心，但又很严肃，也许还想忍住笑！\"！\n\n我会附上我的咖啡馆的参考资料！我希望视角能从阳台上瞄准，这样你就能看到背景中的森林。\n\n厄里斯/朋友/咆哮者\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gl8nBGaRP0YJOkCXD0wDjp7isNMN8qzX?usp=drive_link\n\n我/倾听者\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16TL9eG1JRm7kEasI6C5CjsRuFHKVoCyb?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16TL9eG1JRm7kEasI6C5CjsRuFHKVoCyb?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7165c0b/uploads/origins/0abc1a99-decc-49b5-92a4-652e948d27be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36afe65cbaff56aadf9f3170d2738196", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7165c0b/uploads/origins/0abc1a99-decc-49b5-92a4-652e948d27be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36afe65cbaff56aadf9f3170d2738196, https://si.imgix.net/a7165c0b/uploads/origins/0abc1a99-decc-49b5-92a4-652e948d27be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91f88e3bf0e8b36cb19a7550c291ec66 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7165c0b/uploads/origins/0abc1a99-decc-49b5-92a4-652e948d27be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5630bdced41cd7360e73e7d589c3adb6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "您好！我非常喜欢您的艺术作品，我想为我和我的朋友Ozzy创作一幅作品！\n\n我已经在Google Drive中链接了人物参考和姿势参考：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1H9ESZ0ZEEIOCoe07Dyedfencbp2Zj8hr?usp=sharing\n\nYue是一个善良和有爱心的月兔女神，她正在探索地球。Ozzy是一只猫头鹰，也是云朵咖啡馆的咖啡师/店主，人很好，但也可能很调皮。他们俩有着兄妹般的友谊，互相关心，但也经常争吵。\n\n请按照参考资料中的姿势来画他们！Ozzy会拉着Yue的脸颊。背景方面，如果可以的话，请将他们画在秋天的环境中，他们坐在公园的长椅上！\n\n重点：\n- 小月头发上的月亮/星星火花\n- Ozzy的眼镜\n\n感谢您的时间和考虑！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dd286467/uploads/origins/52b3fe20-1e51-41d3-985d-7f0845d4df21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4eeb6121b2e52eb7374450675a20666", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dd286467/uploads/origins/52b3fe20-1e51-41d3-985d-7f0845d4df21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4eeb6121b2e52eb7374450675a20666, https://si.imgix.net/dd286467/uploads/origins/52b3fe20-1e51-41d3-985d-7f0845d4df21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36017412b7eff996cd006389b9f3b28d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dd286467/uploads/origins/52b3fe20-1e51-41d3-985d-7f0845d4df21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef30908f3fc7a4fc66acfbf0a642f0eb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，我非常喜欢你的艺术风格!我想请你为我的两个原创人物画一幅插图。\n\n🌿 [A] 韩沐阳\n身高181厘米，站立。棕色头发，从前面看是短发，在后面扎成一个齐腰的马尾辫。右眼为紫色，左眼为虹彩蓝色。有像蛇一样的狭长瞳孔和锋利的犬齿。性格开朗，和蔼可亲。是一位植物研究者。他的下半身是蛇的。右耳上有白色的羽毛耳环。\n\n🔥 [B] 莫子煜\n身高186厘米。比A小2岁。白色长发。火焰色的眼睛。一个安静但紧张的人。美丽而英俊。一个中国戏曲表演者。肌肉匀称。有像秘书鸟的翅膀。他对A有保护性的感情。红眼和唇妆，左耳有黑色流苏耳环。\n\nA和B是童年的朋友和恋人。他们一起在一个古老的中国幻境中旅行。\n\n谢谢你如果要求不合适，请随时拒绝。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13oER8K621h27id0z6EH24UJLttvkPe4w", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ab38326/uploads/origins/cb431ab3-f835-4308-9bbd-99a50e7ab99f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31f867d1a04a134e6734ec159eb992c5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ab38326/uploads/origins/cb431ab3-f835-4308-9bbd-99a50e7ab99f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31f867d1a04a134e6734ec159eb992c5, https://si.imgix.net/4ab38326/uploads/origins/cb431ab3-f835-4308-9bbd-99a50e7ab99f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a17d8d2809a7c56e4d218f8d45ef4a63 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ab38326/uploads/origins/cb431ab3-f835-4308-9bbd-99a50e7ab99f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56eed474984452e0c0b5c071e58172b3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，我希望你过得很好。我真的很喜欢你画颜色和光线的方式，我想知道你是否能画出这两个人物的浪漫关系，他们都很年轻，爱玩，而且非常快乐。\n\n你能不能把他们画在外面，在美丽的天空下，周围有一些花瓣 >///< 对于姿势，我想和参考资料类似，但可以随意改变，以你认为最好的方式，构图由你决定!谢谢你的时间 ^^\n\n姿势：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FrwvUV3ooi8Wj2vdbrOwAbQcZ5JPIUVZ?usp=sharing\n\n角色细节在这里：\n\n克里斯 ( 163 cm )\n- 女性，天使狙击手 ( 翅膀是可选的 )\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xbBBLhLHWWmj0HdVf6JCjuJuc_oO2gzy?usp=sharing\n\n利亚 ( 165 cm )\n- 男，异次元狐狸王子（水晶翅膀是可选的）。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xzhiNwKG5oaPEe65oyM6Ge3WQ6V_xJPi?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b56bdfb8/uploads/origins/b3cb1ce8-18fa-4f06-b2ab-ba05812c49da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f60d42863d99192b90edabf4e50b009", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b56bdfb8/uploads/origins/b3cb1ce8-18fa-4f06-b2ab-ba05812c49da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f60d42863d99192b90edabf4e50b009, https://si.imgix.net/b56bdfb8/uploads/origins/b3cb1ce8-18fa-4f06-b2ab-ba05812c49da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be926586850ede4304ddd69c1b4492e8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b56bdfb8/uploads/origins/b3cb1ce8-18fa-4f06-b2ab-ba05812c49da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4987bca1ed0c67e05df92efc25e73ec0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好!我喜欢你画的颜色和光线！!\n\n我很想得到我的两个大象的艺术作品，Han和Leigh。他们的参考资料在这里：\n汉（170厘米）：\nhttps://orig00.deviantart.net/0782/f/2018/242/b/2/010118_l_by_caephuier-dclku1c.png\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/32923432_1W9IdwMNIBei2tZ.png\n\n利(186厘米)\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/58058821_5jqyVpnIBHgJeyv.png?1674470354\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FomBtFMaMAAmYbO?format=jpg&name=large\n\n他们都是男孩，但汉是雌雄同体的!他们非常开心，很爱玩!他们处于一种浪漫的关系中。他们喜欢在大自然和古老的废墟中探索，并一起跳舞。他们也都非常擅长魔法。我把他们的服装和姿势留给你--我唯一的具体要求是，莉有雀斑，而且他们都有相配的项链！这是我的要求！汉的翅膀是可选的。我在想他们享受彼此的陪伴，或一起使用魔法的一些场景。\n\n再次感谢您!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/449652e7/uploads/origins/df3008f8-7926-4efd-bf92-19c106dedd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82657708d59d01a925b2d875a7de24a9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/449652e7/uploads/origins/df3008f8-7926-4efd-bf92-19c106dedd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82657708d59d01a925b2d875a7de24a9, https://si.imgix.net/449652e7/uploads/origins/df3008f8-7926-4efd-bf92-19c106dedd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd01c415b6400195355eff24ef2e83f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/449652e7/uploads/origins/df3008f8-7926-4efd-bf92-19c106dedd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c44104f83b1b7bcfb4816504d85b155 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "很高兴见到你。我非常欣赏你的作品，如果这幅作品被接受，我将非常高兴我想请求为2个原创人物画一幅插图。\n\n🐺 角色A，184cm。一个猎人。他画的是地图。一个冷静和严肃的角色。宽阔的肩膀。浓眉大眼。请注意他的肤色。你可以选择他的服装，或者你可以创造一个原始的服装。主题: 箭头、地图、羊皮纸、指南针\n\n⭐人物B. 172cm.她是一个可爱和开朗的精灵女孩，喜欢旅行和飞行请注意她脸上的标记和肤色。主题: 星星，星座，春天，彩色的鸟儿\n\n🤝 他们是如何认识的？\n他们两人是幻想中的人物!角色A充当角色B的 \"导师\"。\n\n请画出人物A和B展示他们的射箭技能!至于其余的构图，我就交给你了!如果要求有任何问题，请毫不犹豫地拒绝。谢谢您!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/o7n3argdhnqgfsd/AACl23fcZ7V3nB1qFPH8Wz53a?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Amu_let_/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9724e22/uploads/origins/8d021424-73e1-429a-b964-944b65b353d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1af91ec1b1b8591682a0807c41104761", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9724e22/uploads/origins/8d021424-73e1-429a-b964-944b65b353d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1af91ec1b1b8591682a0807c41104761, https://si.imgix.net/b9724e22/uploads/origins/8d021424-73e1-429a-b964-944b65b353d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&